BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond
UID:event_316155060@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041935Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260906T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260906T093000
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Master Swim - Volunteer Kayak Escorts
DESCRIPTION:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond\nHello All\nThe Santa Rosa Mas
 ter Swimmers do an open water swim at Lake Sonoma every Sunday morning.\nT
 hey usually hit the water at 8am.\nThe group starts the swim at the beach 
 just to the right of the PUBLIC boat ramp and under the bridge.\nIf you ar
 e interested in being an Kayak Escort for the swimmers they really appreci
 ate having you around.\n\nThis is a very informal and laid back event.\n\n
 PLEASE NOTE:\nI am not always at this event\, even though I am the host of
  the event.\nIf I am not going to be there I will leave a comment on the e
 vent.\n\nFor Question / Concerns\nPlease call\nBrent Swinth\n707 867 8166
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/kayaking-sonoma-beyond/events/3161550
 60/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260817T151255Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260817T151255Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
